# Divisi: the notes of a chord are divided among the section's players, one
# note each (a solo plays the double stops it can). Render with --players N.
tempo 60
0 poly divisi
0 dyn 0.55
0 vib 0.5
0 note C3 7 70          # three lines: C3 (C string), G3 (D string), C4 (A string)
0 note G3 7 70
0 note C4 3 70
3 note E3 4 75          # the top line moves down to E3, under G3
8 bow on
8 note G2 2 85          # two lines, short and stopped on the string (staccato)
8 note D3 2 85
10 note G2 2 85
10 note B2 2 85
13 note C3 4 70         # one line again: the whole section plays it
13 note G3 4 70
